<item>
            <title>[LU-20853] build: lnet.service is not packaged on Ubuntu 26.04 when systemd-dev is not installed</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20853</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;systemd.pc is shipped in systemd-dev on Ubuntu 26.04. Without it, configure silently disables systemd support, and packages built by make debs/make dkms-debs do not include lnet.service or the other unit files.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
root@ubuntu2604:~/fs-lustre-release# dpkg -l | grep systemd-dev
&amp;lt;nothing&amp;gt;

root@ubuntu2604:~/fs-lustre-release# pkg-config --variable=systemdsystemunitdir systemd
&amp;lt;nothing&amp;gt;

root@ubuntu2604:~/fs-lustre-release# ./autogen.sh &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ./configure --disable-server --with-o2ib=/usr/src/ofa_kernel/x86_64/7.0.0-31-&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;generic&lt;/span&gt; &amp;amp;&amp;amp; make &amp;amp;&amp;amp; make dkms-debs
...

root@ubuntu2604:~/fs-lustre-release# cd debs/
root@ubuntu2604:~/fs-lustre-release/debs# dpkg -c lustre-client-utils_2.17.58-39-g094031c-1_amd64.deb | grep system
&amp;lt;nothing&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
